  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1303.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to implement the statutory provisions relative to planning renovations to existing career and technical education facilities.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 1300) #12573, eff 7-14-18",
